// The world's cultures, from data/world.ron's `clubs.cultures`: the continent its
// clubs are at home on, the names a club of that culture may take, the patterns it
// is named by, and the stage names of its fighters. No two fighters in activity
// bear the same name: few names, so that they come back once their fighter is gone;
// when all are borne, the least borne is numbered ("Flamma II"). A culture's shown
// name is `culture-<key>` in the language files (assets/lang), a pattern's
// `club-<pattern>`, which puts the drawn name in place of `$name`.
